WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.080 line:85%
Welcome to ArrivePing.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.750 line:85%
We’ve loaded a sample day, so you can see it working right away.

3
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:11.490 line:85%
Sample technicians, sample jobs, and one van already on the move.

4
00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:12.900 line:85%
Here’s the heart of it.

5
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.780 line:85%
When a technician taps “On the way,”

6
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.160 line:85%
your customer gets a text with a live tracking link.

7
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.960 line:85%
No app to download.

8
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.790 line:85%
If the technician is running late, the ETA updates itself.

9
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:27.020 line:85%
And when they arrive, it’s confirmed automatically.

10
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:31.190 line:85%
Nine short guides, about two minutes each, walk you through the rest.

11
00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.960 line:85%
Start any of them from the question-mark button.

12
00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.830 line:85%
Your launch checklist shows what to do next.

13
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.710 line:85%
Create a real job.

14
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.350 line:85%
Invite a technician.

15
00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:42.880 line:85%
Send your first live ETA.

16
00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.860 line:85%
Set your reply-to email.

17
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.010 line:85%
And make a milestone message your own.

18
00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:49.450 line:85%
It ticks itself off as you go.

19
00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.020 line:85%
Clear the sample data whenever you’re ready.

20
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.880 line:85%
Questions? Ask ArrivePing anytime,

21
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.800 line:85%
or email support@nvc360.com.
